{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734084",
      "title": "Behind-the-Scenes Work with useFetcher()",
      "sourceHash": "29284fae455c7ca35b6a087c63b0d227c02e2e0166d26236c2206ec91199cf9f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.84,
          "en": "Now slowly but steadily,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.84,
          "end": 7.8,
          "en": "we're coming to an end of this arguably really big module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.8,
          "end": 11.07,
          "en": "but there is a lot to teach regarding Routing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 12.15,
          "en": "as you can tell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.15,
          "end": 15.06,
          "en": "And this is the complete guide course after all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.06,
          "end": 19.08,
          "en": "not the 'I just teach you some parts of it' guide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.08,
          "end": 22.29,
          "en": "but still we're getting closer to concluding this module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.29,
          "end": 25.86,
          "en": "But there still are a couple of important features offered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.86,
          "end": 28.29,
          "en": "by React Router you should know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 32.34,
          "en": "And to introduce the first feature, you'll find a couple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.34,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "of updated code files attached to this lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 39.27,
          "en": "You'll find an updated main navigation js file where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.27,
          "end": 43.59,
          "en": "I added a new link and this new newsletter signup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.59,
          "end": 46.44,
          "en": "component, which is another component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.44,
          "end": 49.08,
          "en": "you'll find attached newsletters sign up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.08,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "which renders a simple form with a input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 53.82,
          "en": "which could be used by users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.82,
          "end": 56.943,
          "en": "to sign up for an imaginary newsletter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.96,
          "end": 61.023,
          "en": "There also is a CSS file for this component attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.55,
          "end": 65.55,
          "en": "Then I added the newsletter.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.55,
          "end": 67.98,
          "en": "which should go into the pages folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.98,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "which also renders this newsletter signup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 74.52,
          "en": "component wrapped into this page content component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.52,
          "end": 77.67,
          "en": "And where I defined dummy action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.67,
          "end": 79.83,
          "en": "That doesn't really do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.83,
          "end": 83.76,
          "en": "but that does extract the provided email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.76,
          "end": 86.52,
          "en": "and we could then send it to some backend server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.52,
          "end": 88.71000000000001,
          "en": "But here we're not doing anything with it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.71000000000001,
          "end": 92.13300000000001,
          "en": "because we don't need to do anything with it for this demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.3,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "And in app js, I also added a new route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.25999999999999,
          "end": 101.19,
          "en": "and therefore you'll find the updated app js file attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.19,
          "end": 103.33500000000001,
          "en": "I added this newsletter route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.33500000000001,
          "end": 108.33500000000001,
          "en": "on the same level as my homepage route essentially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.66,
          "end": 111.81,
          "en": "And this route renders the newsletter page component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.81,
          "end": 113.00999999999999,
          "en": "which I just showed you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.00999999999999,
          "end": 115.953,
          "en": "and has the newsletter action attached to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.94,
          "end": 119.03999999999999,
          "en": "Now, I did add these components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.03999999999999,
          "end": 121.08,
          "en": "and this route because there is a new feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.08,
          "end": 123.6,
          "en": "I wanna show you, as mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.6,
          "end": 125.82,
          "en": "And for that, it's important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.82,
          "end": 128.64,
          "en": "that we have this newsletter signup form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.64,
          "end": 133.2,
          "en": "both on the newsletter page as well as on every other page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 136.32,
          "en": "because it is included here in the main navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.32,
          "end": 139.893,
          "en": "So it's not just on one single page, but on all pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.09,
          "end": 143.19,
          "en": "The problem with that is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.19,
          "end": 145.95,
          "en": "of course we wanna trigger this action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.95,
          "end": 147.57,
          "en": "this newsletterAction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.57,
          "end": 151.17000000000002,
          "en": "whenever this newsletter form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.17000000000002,
          "end": 153.78,
          "en": "And if we are on the newsletter page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.78,
          "end": 155.37,
          "en": "if we are on this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.37,
          "end": 158.73,
          "en": "that would be quite straightforward to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.73,
          "end": 162.81,
          "en": "All we had to do is go to the newsletter signup component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 164.64,
          "en": "which is where we have this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.64,
          "end": 168.36,
          "en": "and use React Router's form component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.36,
          "end": 170.91,
          "en": "which starts with a capital F.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.91,
          "end": 173.16,
          "en": "And as you learned that would automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.16,
          "end": 175.26,
          "en": "trigger the action that belongs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.26,
          "end": 177.39,
          "en": "to the currently active route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.39,
          "end": 181.59,
          "en": "The problem is however, that this form is included",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.59,
          "end": 184.92,
          "en": "on all routes because it's part of the main navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.92,
          "end": 187.32,
          "en": "This newsletter signup component is part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.32,
          "end": 189.36,
          "en": "of the main navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.36,
          "end": 193.56,
          "en": "Therefore, we would have to add the action to all routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.56,
          "end": 195.03,
          "en": "and that would of course be a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.03,
          "end": 197.61,
          "en": "of code duplication and also clash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 200.973,
          "en": "with other actions that we might need for our routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.2,
          "end": 204.57,
          "en": "Now this is such a common use case that React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.57,
          "end": 206.52,
          "en": "Router has a solution for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.52,
          "end": 209.1,
          "en": "There is a special hook which you can import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.1,
          "end": 213.36,
          "en": "from react-router-dom, and that is the useFetcher hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.22,
          "end": 216.66,
          "en": "The name might be a bit strange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.66,
          "end": 220.74,
          "en": "but this hook when executed gives you an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.74,
          "end": 223.07999999999998,
          "en": "And this object includes a bunch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.07999999999998,
          "end": 225.663,
          "en": "of useful properties and methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.13,
          "end": 230.57999999999998,
          "en": "For example, it gives you another form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.57999999999998,
          "end": 233.28,
          "en": "which is different from that other form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 235.11,
          "en": "we used before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.11,
          "end": 237.66,
          "en": "It also gives you a submit function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.66,
          "end": 240.42,
          "en": "which is different from the submit function we got",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.42,
          "end": 243.12,
          "en": "from useSubmit, which we used before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.12,
          "end": 246.03,
          "en": "But what is the difference between this form we get here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.03,
          "end": 248.463,
          "en": "and this submit function which we get here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.57,
          "end": 253.648,
          "en": "Well, if we use this Fetcher Form component like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 253.648,
          "end": 258.648,
          "en": "which we can then this will actually still trigger an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 259.14,
          "end": 262.89300000000003,
          "en": "but it will not initialize a route transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.51,
          "end": 267.33,
          "en": "So Fetcher should basically be used whenever",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.33,
          "end": 271.2,
          "en": "you wanna trigger, an action, or also a loader",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.2,
          "end": 275.31,
          "en": "with help of the load function without actually navigating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 275.31,
          "end": 277.86,
          "en": "to the page to which the loader belongs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 277.86,
          "end": 280.263,
          "en": "or the page to which the action belongs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 281.34000000000003,
          "end": 284.67,
          "en": "On this form here we can add the action attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 284.67,
          "end": 288.09000000000003,
          "en": "and for example, point at /newsletter because I know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 288.09000000000003,
          "end": 291.96,
          "en": "that I wanna trigger the action off that newsletter route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 291.96,
          "end": 292.95,
          "en": "but I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 292.95,
          "end": 296.67,
          "en": "that I don't load that route's component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 296.67,
          "end": 300.63,
          "en": "I don't wanna load the element that belongs to this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 300.63,
          "end": 303.45,
          "en": "And with the default form, we would do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 303.45,
          "end": 306.54,
          "en": "If I add form here without Fetcher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 306.54,
          "end": 309.33,
          "en": "just to show you what the difference is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 309.33,
          "end": 311.91,
          "en": "you will notice that if I set up this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 311.91,
          "end": 315.76,
          "en": "like this with the default form provided by React Router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 316.8,
          "end": 321.8,
          "en": "if I go to Events and I then enter some email address here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.86,
          "end": 326.01,
          "en": "I'm forwarded to the Events page after submitting this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 326.01,
          "end": 328.443,
          "en": "And that's not the behavior I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 329.82,
          "end": 332.76,
          "en": "Now, it changes if I use fetcher.Form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 332.76,
          "end": 336.6,
          "en": "because as I mentioned with Fetcher, we don't transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 336.6,
          "end": 338.613,
          "en": "we don't move to a different route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 339.87,
          "end": 340.98,
          "en": "So now we can get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 340.98,
          "end": 344.04,
          "en": "of the form import and use Fetcher form instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 344.04,
          "end": 348.33,
          "en": "And now if I'm on Events and I enter my details here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 348.33,
          "end": 351.9,
          "en": "now I submit this without transitioning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 351.9,
          "end": 353.22,
          "en": "Now we don't get a feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 353.22,
          "end": 355.40999999999997,
          "en": "because I haven't added any logic for this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 355.40999999999997,
          "end": 357.69,
          "en": "but we saw before that it seemed to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 357.69,
          "end": 360.27,
          "en": "since we did transition with that other form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 361.53,
          "end": 365.22,
          "en": "And we can get a feedback by using other properties provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 365.22,
          "end": 366.78,
          "en": "by Fetcher because useFetcher,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 366.78,
          "end": 371.25,
          "en": "this useFetcher hook, is basically the tool you should use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 371.25,
          "end": 372.63,
          "en": "if you wanna interact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 372.63,
          "end": 375.96,
          "en": "with some action or a loader without transitioning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 375.96,
          "end": 379.65,
          "en": "So if you wanna send your requests behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 379.65,
          "end": 383.55,
          "en": "so to say, without triggering any route changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 383.55,
          "end": 385.29,
          "en": "and because that's the goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 385.29,
          "end": 388.68,
          "en": "or that's where Fetcher wants to help you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 388.68,
          "end": 391.14,
          "en": "this Fetcher object also includes a bunch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 391.14,
          "end": 393.81,
          "en": "of properties that help you understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 393.81,
          "end": 398.43,
          "en": "whether your action or loader that you triggered succeeded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 398.43,
          "end": 400.8,
          "en": "You also get access to any data returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 400.8,
          "end": 403.83,
          "en": "by that loader or action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 403.83,
          "end": 405.57,
          "en": "You get access to that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 405.57,
          "end": 408.573,
          "en": "through that data property here to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 410.01,
          "end": 413.97,
          "en": "So we can actually use object Destructuring to pull",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 413.97,
          "end": 418.40999999999997,
          "en": "out that data property, that data object, which is returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 418.40999999999997,
          "end": 420.933,
